 "title": "20 UI Tricks to Fix an AI Slop Website",
 "topic": "design",
 "summary": "The creator lists 20 specific UI fixes to improve poor AI-generated website designs. The main lesson is to remove generic design trends like purple gradients, glowing elements, and excessive hype words in favor of a cleaner, more practical layout.",
 "key_points": [
  "Kill the purple gradient and gradient text.",
  "Lose the glow and delete the glossy blob.",
  "Remove emojis in the navigation bar.",
  "Drop the pill above the headline and say what the product actually does.",
  "Cut the hype words and stop centering everything.",
  "Use one main button instead of three, and remove fake reviews.",
  "Set spacing on a four-point grid and avoid making every corner a pill.",
  "Pick a font that is not Inter.",
  "Ditch the stat banner, remove tiny all-caps labels, and get rid of icon boxes in every card.",
  "Make each card say something real, stop the bouncing elements, and give the site one bright moment worth looking at."
 ],
 "content": "20 niche UI tricks to fix an AI slop website\n1. Purple gradient\n2. Gradient text\n3. Glow\n4. Glossy blob\n5. Emoji in the nav\n6. Pill above headline\n7. Say what it does\n8. Hype words\n9. Centred everything\n10. One main button\n11. Fake reviews\n12. 4-point grid\n13. Pill corners\n14. Not Inter\n15. Stat banner\n16. Tiny ALL CAPS\n17. Icon boxes\n18. Cards say something\n19. Bouncing\n20. One bright moment\n\nTranscript:\nI am sick of your shitty slop sites. Kill the purple gradient, no gradient text, lose the glow, delete the glossy blob, no emoji in the nav, drop the pill above the headline, say what it actually does, cut the hype words, stop centering everything, one main button, not three, no fake reviews, spacing on a four-point grid, not every corner's a pill, pick a font that isn't Inter, ditch the stat banner, no tiny all caps labels, no icon box in every card, make each card say something real, stop the bouncing, and give it one thing worth looking at. Comment fix and I'll send you the guide to de-slop your shitty website.\n\nOn screen text:\n20 niche UI tricks to fix an AI slop website\n1. Purple gradient\n2. Gradient text\n3. Glow\n4. Glossy blob\n5. Emoji in the nav\n6. Pill above headline\n7. Say what it does\n8. Hype words\n9. Centered everything\n10. One main button\n11. Fake reviews\n12. 4-point grid\n13. Pill corners\n14. Not Inter\n15. Stat banner\n16. Tiny ALL CAPS\n17. Icon boxes\n18. Cards say something\n19. Bouncing\n20. One bright moment\nComment \"FIX\" for the guide",
